00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:33.680
But you actually multiply that by two, so you have a little bit of margin,

00:08:34.270 --> 00:08:40.920
what we call a factor of safety, so it's actually capable of 31 PSI to be where we were comfortable.

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:48.420
It actually failed at 53 PSI, significantly higher than its design ultimate capability.

00:08:49.310 --> 00:08:54.290
But that shows that we have a fair amount of damage tolerance still remaining in the design.

